<title>NETHERLANDS: ABN AMRO unit bids for 49 pct of Asia Secs.</title>
<headline>ABN AMRO unit bids for 49 pct of Asia Secs.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABN AMRO Hoare Govett Asia (Holdings) Ltd said on Wednesday it launched a tender offer totalling Baht 2.2 billion for 49 percent of Asia Securities Trading Public Company Limited.</p>
</text>
